        "name": "YT2_S01_P56",
        "why": "System 1 operating code"
      },
      {
        "ref": "BV 5",
        "name": "YT2_S01_P36",
        "why": "Chiller running"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AV 5",
        "name": "YT2_S01_P11",
        "why": "Leaving chilled liquid temperature"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AV 6",
        "name": "YT2_S01_P12",
        "why": "Entering chilled liquid temperature"
      },
      {
        "ref": "MV 2",
        "name": "YT2_S01_P57",
        "why": "System 1 fault code"
      },
      {
        "ref": "BV 6",
        "name": "YT2_S01_P37",
        "why": "Chiller alarm (1 = alarm)"
      }
    ],
    "enable": "The E-Link remote slots (AV 1-4, BV 1-4) are the BMS commands; the chiller panel must be set for remote (ISN/BAS) control for them to take effect.",
    "heartbeat": null,
    "remote_sensors": null,
    "setup": [
      "The E-Link gateway talks to the chiller microboard over YorkTalk 2 and serves BACnet, N2, LON and Modbus; BACnet addressing is set on the E-Link.",
      "Check the chiller program version against the sheet's version table; availability codes (S/O/N) are per version."
    ],
